    "description": {
      "value": "Golden images of heroic deeds decorate the black plates of this full plate. You gain resistance 5 to mental damage and a +1 status bonus to saves against fear.\n\n**Activate\u2014Personal Legend**\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Traits:** concentrate\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nThe scenes depicted on your armor shift and change, making room to accommodate your current heroic feats. You cast heroism on yourself.\n\nThe armor is full plate, the resistance increases to 10, the status bonus increases to +2, and heroism is heightened to 6th-rank."
